# SoPlex at tier T2 — T1 with the simplifier switched on.
#
# -s0 is gone; that is the whole difference from T1, and T2 minus T1 is what
# presolve is worth. solvemode stays at 0, because "auto" may run iterative
# refinement and that is a different amount of work rather than a different
# feature.

--solvemode=0
-f1e-7
-o1e-7
